      "subject": "flow_001_launch_i_GrfDriveToLaunch_1",
      "explanation": "该流以输入端口i_GrfDriveToLaunch_1为起点，首先与SRF驱动流在grfSrfMerge中合并，随后通过grfSplitter拆分为两条路径，分别进入rele2Merge和rele3Merge。这两条路径分别与来自rele6Splitter的释放信号合并，再经过rele2Selector和rele3Selector的选择与延迟，最终通过rs1Merge和rs2Merge汇聚到regMerge。此后，事件流经launchSplitter、regSelector、regSplitter等组件，最终通过grfSrfSele输出到o_launchDriveToGrf_1和o_launchDriveToSrf_1，并通过exeMerge2输出到o_launchDriveToExe_1。整个流程体现了事件从单一输入到多目标输出的扇出与同步机制。",
      "signals": [
        "i_GrfDriveToLaunch_1",
